{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpi",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Duplicated UUIDs",
                  "field": "finding_count",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Affected objects",
                  "field": "affected_objects",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Affected files",
                  "field": "affected_files",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Type conflicts",
                  "field": "type_conflicts",
                  "format": "count"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "pairs_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "File pairs sharing UUIDs",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "file_pairs"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "pairs_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "pageParam": "pairs_page",
              "searchParam": "pairs_q",
              "sortParam": "pairs_sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search file…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "file_a",
                  "label": "File A"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file_b",
                  "label": "File B"
                },
                {
                  "field": "shared_uuids",
                  "label": "Shared UUIDs",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "pct_of_a",
                  "label": "% of A",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "pct_of_b",
                  "label": "% of B",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "empty": {
                "message": "No file pair shares a native UUID."
              },
              "alwaysShowCount": true
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Colliding objects",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "comfortable",
              "sortable": true,
              "searchable": "auto",
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "searchAutoThreshold": 3,
              "searchPlaceholder": "Search name, file or UUID…",
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "nav_uuid",
                  "label": "UUID",
                  "align": "center",
                  "format": "copy"
                },
                {
                  "field": "type",
                  "label": "Type",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "name",
                  "label": "Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file_count",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "field": "type_conflict",
                  "label": "Type conflict",
                  "format": "badge"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}"
                }
              },
              "empty": {
                "message": "No UUID exists in more than one file — no clone collisions."
              },
              "alwaysShowCount": true
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "notes_card",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "About this check"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Markdown",
            "id": "notes_md",
            "props": {
              "content": "Cloned FileMaker files carry the clone's UUIDs, so the same UUID identifies **different objects in different files**. The solution itself runs fine — but developer tooling that assumes UUID uniqueness (DDR tools, fmIDE, diff/merge, UUID-keyed integrations) can pick the wrong object.\n\n**There is no automatic fix.** Claris' repair mode assigns entirely new UUIDs and thereby breaks every external UUID reference. Treat the pair *(UUID, file)* as the object identity in your tooling. Rows marked **type conflict** are the most dangerous collisions — the same UUID names objects of *different types*.\n\nOnly native FileMaker UUIDs are checked; FM-Lab's synthetic identities are excluded by design. Duplicates *within* a single file are covered by the companion dashboard **UUID Intra-File Duplicates**."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
